window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-033-62ec5c06d147c186.json"]={sha256:"62ec5c06d147c1869c002741be22863540490eef30f2177da97a1412d8321aab",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-82ec246c777e380c","url":"https://docs.sigstore.dev/about/bundle/","title":"Sigstore bundle format","titleEn":"Sigstore bundle format","publisher":"Sigstore","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-f11f955bc62a53c6","url":"https://docs.sigstore.dev/cosign/verifying/timestamps/","title":"Sigstore timestamps: Rekor v1 and v2","titleEn":"Sigstore timestamps: Rekor v1 and v2","publisher":"Sigstore","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-033","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-033","related":[{"id":"security-v27-034","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/sigstore/architecture-docs/blob/main/rekor-spec.md"],"title":"Rekor：檢查點連續性與分裂視圖證據限制","titleEn":"Rekor: checkpoint continuity and limits of split-view evidence","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：300與50秒可重算，未簽署時間與錯產物均拒絕；歷史有效性不被誤述為憑證永久有效。 交付bundle-time-contract.json、證據完整性表與三種負例；所有時間與憑證皆為合成描述。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 300 and 50 seconds and reject unauthenticated time and wrong artifacts. Historical validity must not be described as indefinite certificate validity. Deliver bundle-time-contract.json, the evidence-completeness table and three counterexamples. All timestamps and certificates are synthetic descriptors rather than claims about a real signed release.","difference":"建立可信起始檢查點、後續樹大小、根雜湊與證明狀態；每個檢查點先驗證簽章，再依所屬log/shard比較連續性。","differenceEn":"Build a trusted initial checkpoint and later tree sizes, root hashes and proof results. Verify checkpoint signatures before continuity checks, keeping log and shard identifiers explicit so unrelated trees cannot be compared as one append-only sequence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課先假設鏈、時間簽章與身分政策通過，再計算簽署時間距有效期兩端的較小餘裕；此數值不是撤銷或來源政策的替代。 憑證有效區間1000至1600秒，可信簽署時間1300秒；觀測時刻可以晚於憑證到期，但必須保有符合選定驗證流程的歷史時間證據。 兩端餘裕min(1300−1000,1600−1300)=300秒；可信時間改1550後較小餘裕50秒。","本課計算已驗證連續轉移佔所有預期轉移的比例；這是證據覆蓋指標，不是透明日誌誠實機率。簽章正確並不單獨證明兩個根前綴一致。 有7個依序檢查點形成6段轉移，其中4段具有效一致性證明，2段缺證明；所有簽章與log識別已先通過。 覆蓋率4/(7−1)×100≈66.667%；補齊一段有效證明後為5/6×100≈83.333%，仍有一段未確認。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["After independent chain, timestamp-signature and identity-policy checks pass, calculate the smaller distance from signing time to the certificate validity endpoints. This number does not replace revocation considerations, provenance policy or verification of the timestamp authority. The certificate interval is 1000 through 1600 seconds and trusted signing time is 1300. Observation may occur later, but acceptance requires historical time evidence appropriate to the selected verification workflow, not merely a certificate that once existed. Endpoint margin is min(1300−1000, 1600−1300)=300 seconds. Moving trusted signing time to 1550 reduces it to 50 seconds, while leaving artifact and identity checks independently necessary.","Measure verified consecutive transitions among expected transitions as evidence coverage, not the probability that a log is honest. Valid checkpoint signatures alone do not establish that one committed tree is an append-only prefix of another. Seven ordered checkpoints create six transitions. Four have valid consistency proofs and two lack them; signatures and log identities have already passed independent checks, isolating continuity evidence from checkpoint authentication. Coverage is 4/(7−1)×100, approximately 66.667 percent. Adding one valid proof yields 5/6×100, approximately 83.333 percent, leaving a transition unresolved rather than proving complete continuity.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-043","referenceUrls":["https://www.gnu.org/software/mes/manual/mes.html"],"title":"GNU Guix與Mes：引導種子與工具鏈信任閉包","titleEn":"GNU Guix and Mes: bootstrap seeds and toolchain trust closure","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：300與50秒可重算，未簽署時間與錯產物均拒絕；歷史有效性不被誤述為憑證永久有效。 交付bundle-time-contract.json、證據完整性表與三種負例；所有時間與憑證皆為合成描述。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 300 and 50 seconds and reject unauthenticated time and wrong artifacts. Historical validity must not be described as indefinite certificate validity. Deliver bundle-time-contract.json, the evidence-completeness table and three counterexamples. All timestamps and certificates are synthetic descriptors rather than claims about a real signed release.","difference":"建立12個簡化工具鏈節點，列每個節點的來源、建置前驅、二進位種子與驗證方式；以有向無環圖找出所有無來源重建路徑的葉節點。","differenceEn":"Build 12 simplified toolchain nodes with source, build predecessor, binary seed and verification method. Traverse the directed acyclic graph to identify leaves lacking a source reconstruction path instead of judging only the final compiler artifact.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課先假設鏈、時間簽章與身分政策通過，再計算簽署時間距有效期兩端的較小餘裕；此數值不是撤銷或來源政策的替代。 憑證有效區間1000至1600秒，可信簽署時間1300秒；觀測時刻可以晚於憑證到期，但必須保有符合選定驗證流程的歷史時間證據。 兩端餘裕min(1300−1000,1600−1300)=300秒；可信時間改1550後較小餘裕50秒。","本課計算仍依賴未審查種子的節點數，去重後取相依閉包；節點數不是位元組大小或風險機率，歷史Guix種子縮減數字不混入合成資料。 12個節點中有5個依賴未審查種子，其他7個在本課已審查閉包內；固定平台為教學模型，不宣稱對所有CPU架構適用。 未審查相依比例5/12×100≈41.667%；重建並審查一條種子路徑，使其中2個節點脫離未審查集合後為3/12×100=25%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["After independent chain, timestamp-signature and identity-policy checks pass, calculate the smaller distance from signing time to the certificate validity endpoints. This number does not replace revocation considerations, provenance policy or verification of the timestamp authority. The certificate interval is 1000 through 1600 seconds and trusted signing time is 1300. Observation may occur later, but acceptance requires historical time evidence appropriate to the selected verification workflow, not merely a certificate that once existed. Endpoint margin is min(1300−1000, 1600−1300)=300 seconds. Moving trusted signing time to 1550 reduces it to 50 seconds, while leaving artifact and identity checks independently necessary.","Count nodes still depending on an unreviewed seed after deduplicating the dependency closure. Node count is neither byte size nor compromise probability; do not mix historical Guix reduction figures into this synthetic graph. Five of 12 nodes depend on an unreviewed seed and seven lie within the reviewed classroom closure. Fix the teaching platform and avoid implying that identical bootstrap paths apply to every CPU architecture or operating system. Unreviewed dependency fraction is 5/12×100, approximately 41.667 percent. Rebuilding and reviewing one seed path removes two nodes from that set, leaving 3/12×100=25 percent.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-3992c3cc9abcfa82","url":"https://github.com/sigstore/architecture-docs/blob/main/rekor-spec.md","title":"Rekor transparency service specification","titleEn":"Rekor transparency service specification","publisher":"Sigstore","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-8ad45db3bbbd97b8","url":"https://www.gnu.org/software/mes/manual/mes.html","title":"GNU Mes manual: bootstrap seed and Guix bootstrap process","titleEn":"GNU Mes manual: bootstrap seed and Guix bootstrap process","publisher":"GNU Mes / Free Software Foundation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
